[2https://github.com/songyahui/infer_TempFix](https://github.com/songyahui/infer_TempFix)
[3https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~yahuis/ProveNFix.pdf](https://www.comp.nus.edu.sg/~yahuis/ProveNFix.pdf)
